#: ../installation/update.rst:5
msgid "Updating"
msgstr "Nadogradnja"

#: ../installation/update.rst:7
msgid "If you are using an old Galette release, it's time to update."
msgstr "Ako koristite staro izdanje Galettea, vrijeme je za nadogradnju."

#: ../installation/update.rst:11
msgid "An update is often not something lite, your data may be modified. So, please make sure you made **a backup of your current database**, or you may lost all or a part of your data."
msgstr ""
"Nadogradnja može znatno promijeniti podatke. Obavezno izradite **sigurnosnu "
"kopiju trenutne baze podataka**; inače možete izgubiti dio podataka ili sve "
"podatke."

#: ../installation/update.rst:13
msgid "A backup of all Galette files is also recommended it would be helpful if you find a bug that prevent you to migrate and have to restore an old version;"
msgstr ""
"Preporučuje se i sigurnosna kopija svih Galetteovih datoteka. Korisna je ako "
"pogreška onemogući migraciju pa morate vratiti staru verziju."

#: ../installation/update.rst:17
msgid "Updating from a 0.6x release is deprecated since Galette 1.3. It is not tested anymore (those releases are more than 15 years old!), and your attempt may fail."
msgstr ""
"Nadogradnja s izdanja 0.6x zastarjela je od Galettea 1.3. Više se ne testira "
"(ta izdanja starija su od 15 godina!) i pokušaj može završiti neuspješno."

#: ../installation/update.rst:19
msgid "If this is your case, you should first `migrate to Galette 0.7.8 <https://galette.eu/download/archives/galette-0.7.8.tar.bz2>`_; and do another migration to the latest version."
msgstr ""
"U tom slučaju prvo `prijeđite na Galette 0.7.8 <https://galette.eu/download/"
"archives/galette-0.7.8.tar.bz2>`_, a zatim ponovno migrirajte na najnoviju "
"verziju."

#: ../installation/update.rst:22
msgid "Updating files"
msgstr "Nadogradnja datoteka"

#: ../installation/update.rst:24
msgid "First, logout from your instance, and make sure to use a maintenance mode to prevent other users to reach the instance."
msgstr ""
"Najprije se odjavite iz instalacije i uključite način održavanja kako biste "
"spriječili pristup drugim korisnicima."

#: ../installation/update.rst:26
msgid "Then, download latest Galette version and replace the files. For more information on files installation, refer to the :ref:`prepare installation <preparation>` section."
msgstr ""
"Zatim preuzmite najnoviju verziju Galettea i zamijenite datoteke. Za više "
"informacija pogledajte :ref:`pripremu instalacije <preparation>`."

#: ../installation/update.rst:28
msgid "Some directories keep data and/or configurations and should be copied back to the new instance:"
msgstr ""
"Neke mape sadrže podatke i/ili konfiguraciju te ih treba prenijeti u novu "
"instalaciju:"

#: ../installation/update.rst:30
msgid "``config/config.inc.php``. If the file is present, the update reads everything from it - database password included - and never asks you for a credential again. If it is missing, Galette cannot know it is an update: it would offer a brand new installation instead,"
msgstr ""
"``config/config.inc.php``. Ako datoteka postoji, nadogradnja iz nje čita sve "
"podatke, uključujući lozinku baze, i ne traži ih ponovno. Ako nedostaje, "
"Galette ne zna da je riječ o nadogradnji pa nudi novu instalaciju,"

#: ../installation/update.rst:31
msgid "``data/photos`` your members photos and logos,"
msgstr "``data/photos``: fotografije članova i logotipi,"

#: ../installation/update.rst:32
msgid "``data/exports`` contains CSv exports,"
msgstr "``data/exports``: CSV izvozi,"

#: ../installation/update.rst:33
msgid "``data/files`` contains files from dynamic fields of type file,"
msgstr "``data/files``: datoteke iz dinamičkih polja vrste datoteka,"

#: ../installation/update.rst:34
msgid "``data/attachments`` contains mailing attached documents."
msgstr "``data/attachments``: privici skupnih poruka."

#: ../installation/update.rst:35
msgid "``plugins`` your current plugins. It is a good idea to check if new plugins versions are available ;)"
msgstr ""
"``plugins``: vaši trenutni dodaci. Provjerite postoje li novije verzije "
"dodataka ;)"

#: ../installation/update.rst:37
msgid "Once files are updated, go to your Galette instance. It will ask you if needed to proceed to the update of your database."
msgstr ""
"Nakon zamjene datoteka otvorite svoju instalaciju Galettea. Ako je potrebno, "
"zatražit će nadogradnju baze podataka."

#: ../installation/update.rst:39
msgid "If so, :ref:`enable the installer <enableinstaller>` by creating the ``data/ENABLE_INSTALL`` file, then visit the install URL ``/installer.php`` (ex: https://your.domain.name/installer.php). Galette sees your configuration file and runs an update, you have nothing to choose."
msgstr ""
"Tada :ref:`uključite instalacijski program <enableinstaller>` stvaranjem "
"datoteke ``data/ENABLE_INSTALL`` i otvorite URL ``/installer.php`` (primjer: "
"https://your.domain.name/installer.php). Galette prepoznaje konfiguracijsku "
"datoteku i pokreće nadogradnju; ne morate birati način rada."

#: ../installation/update.rst:41
msgid "If it asks you nothing you're just done already ;)"
msgstr "Ako ništa ne traži, postupak je već dovršen ;)"

#: ../installation/update.rst:45
msgid "Updating database"
msgstr "Nadogradnja baze podataka"

#: ../installation/update.rst:49
msgid "Installing a new Galette release does not strictly means a database update will be required! Sometimes, only updating the files will be enough; even for a major release."
msgstr ""
"Instalacija novog izdanja Galettea ne znači nužno da treba nadograditi bazu "
"podataka! Ponekad je dovoljna zamjena datoteka, čak i za glavno izdanje."

#: ../installation/update.rst:51
msgid "Galette will tell you if an update is needed, no need to \"force\" an update."
msgstr ""
"Galette će javiti treba li nadogradnja; ne trebate je prisilno pokretati."

#: ../installation/update.rst:53
msgid "Update process is very similar to :doc:`Galette installation process <galette>`, with some steps that change. All is mostly transparent, information are provided on each step."
msgstr ""
"Postupak nadogradnje vrlo je sličan :doc:`instalaciji Galettea <galette>`, "
"uz nekoliko promijenjenih koraka. Većina je automatska, a svaki korak daje "
"potrebne informacije."

#: ../installation/update.rst:56
msgid "Database information"
msgstr "Podaci o bazi podataka"

#: ../installation/update.rst:60
msgid "Database information are not asked anymore, and neither is the installation type."
msgstr "Podaci o bazi i vrsta instalacije više se ne traže."

#: ../installation/update.rst:62
msgid "The update reads the database type, host, port, name, user, password and table prefix from your configuration file, and goes straight to the access and permissions check. The form only comes back if that file cannot be read or is incomplete - fill it in with the very same information as before, the table prefix included."
msgstr ""
"Nadogradnja čita vrstu baze, poslužitelj, priključak, naziv, korisnika, "
"lozinku i prefiks tablica iz konfiguracijske datoteke te odmah prelazi na "
"provjeru pristupa i ovlasti. Obrazac se prikazuje samo ako datoteku nije "
"moguće pročitati ili nije potpuna. Tada unesite iste podatke kao prije, "
"uključujući prefiks tablica."

#: ../installation/update.rst:65
msgid "Previous version selection"
msgstr "Odabir prethodne verzije"

#: ../installation/update.rst:69
msgid "When the version can be read from the database, this step is skipped."
msgstr "Ako se verzija može pročitati iz baze podataka, ovaj se korak preskače."

#: ../installation/update.rst:71
msgid "Galette reads the version its database holds and updates from there. The step below is only displayed when that reading is not conclusive - which is the case for a pre 0.7 database, since the table holding the version did not exist yet. Select the version you are coming from, the one Galette guessed is displayed as bold text:"
msgstr ""
"Galette čita verziju zabilježenu u bazi i nadograđuje od nje. Korak u "
"nastavku prikazuje se samo ako verzija nije pouzdano utvrđena, što vrijedi "
"za baze prije 0.7 jer tablica s verzijom tada nije postojala. Odaberite "
"verziju iz koje nadograđujete; Galetteov prijedlog prikazan je podebljano:"

#: ../installation/update.rst:77
msgid "The step is also displayed when your database is already up to date, so you get a chance to stop before running the scripts again:"
msgstr ""
"Korak se prikazuje i ako je baza već ažurna kako biste mogli zaustaviti "
"postupak prije ponovnog izvršavanja skripti:"

#: ../installation/update.rst:83
msgid "Once update scripts have run, a summary will be displayed."
msgstr ""
"Nakon izvršavanja skripti za nadogradnju prikazuje se pregled rezultata."

#: ../installation/update.rst:87
msgid "The ``data/ENABLE_INSTALL`` file is removed once the update has completed."
msgstr ""
"Datoteka ``data/ENABLE_INSTALL`` uklanja se nakon završetka nadogradnje."
